{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 46","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c73ed093cc73a8d9a14185fa525e7067e5c3725d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> be an ordered triplet of real numbers that satisfies the following system of equations: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd4858fa425c2cfc8d99daabdbf5eb82ad12d65.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}x+y^2+z^4&amp;=0,\\\\y+z^2+x^4&amp;=0,\\\\z+x^2+y^4&amp;=0.\\end{align*}\" width=\"125\" height=\"74\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is the minimum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/d/1bdb84051fb8233e3ebdea6034c69ca8a6755464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x^3+y^3+z^3\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" />, find the modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0db9f93bcba529c93ae151a1ac5c740eec7cca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" /> residue of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearrange the terms to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/1679558217897d9d1fad7fdc0f730ed3440937f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2 + z^4 = -x\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a531d971a7d550c655668c09b2cc35f554672c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z^2 + x^4 = -y\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e3f072f42daa64b5c711676c68e6616b7cc294.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + y^4 = -z\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />\nSince the left hand side of all three equations is greater than or equal to 0, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa9d54907249d6bd7a1f91e777189d596d81c13c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z \\le 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />.  Also, note that the equations have symmetry, so <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=WLOG\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"WLOG\">WLOG</a>, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/b/24b52c1e6f4546761173a8eba26e9c334ebbc0ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\ge x \\ge y \\ge z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"110\" height=\"16\" />.  By substitution, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/c/c2cabafb718da2b64064f2b99741a35b94290071.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2 + z^4 \\le z^2 + x^4 \\le x^2 + y^4\\]\" width=\"216\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/7/227fe3a56efb6ee68ec524692f943e349d98d319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le x^2 \\le y^2 \\le z^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/8/87825be8bc9bb84e89cf56ffd27b4d3bd39ee4b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le x^4 \\le y^4 \\le z^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />. That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/e/b9e945a0781df43df64bab18bc1de0b1a5ba7c87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^4 \\le x^2 + z^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/d/b4d9841158abe0cad2d340ac6ee808013c28a205.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 + z^4 \\le x^2 + y^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/9/369e9a819fd88a09c6916e077094b1c0a3d5af89.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2 + z^4 \\le x^2 + z^4\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/a/76ac9d9522218db765049b694172c043431c69bf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2 \\le x^2\\]\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/6/046ebc6b9ee89b08a3f7696bad4386154985b4ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 \\le y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb92a898005eb8b29739af2e98044c091e1a36c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />.  Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are nonpositive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e33fa7c7b2ce1a18e6e0a6d3ef6c08bd1958722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nUsing substitution in the original system,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/a/13a9e295d3bed3e0e22cc546eac18a23b05ed8cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + z^4 = z^2 + x^4\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/f/95f2f780459987fda7223b66aebc0ba3c6cd93ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(z^2 + x^2)(z^2 - x^2) - (z^2 - x^2) = 0\\]\" width=\"266\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/d/6adb7e42c867795172775af159ff902e838ea30a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(z^2 - x^2)(x^2 + z^2 - 1) = 0\\]\" width=\"204\" height=\"19\" />\nTo find the real solutions, we use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Casework\" title=\"Casework\">casework</a> and the Zero Product Property.\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/f/bdf26d9a64eaad9d7528b6b0ee43c1a22d0dd8ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^2 = x^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /></b>\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/f/bdf26d9a64eaad9d7528b6b0ee43c1a22d0dd8ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z^2 = x^2$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" />, then since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> are nonpositive, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/8/a58198f4e1af46ca9b4cc5c42030182900c64aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" />.  Substitution results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373d520075983e8c995fbe5c63926c52f4cf2a71.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+x^2+x^4 = 0\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1bec09aa07b01c15443d3a620ff19f44b51336fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(1+x+x^3) = 0\\]\" width=\"138\" height=\"19\" />\nThat means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/c/83cb4e58309924741f049ee83fd82b80b8980d7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 + x + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />.  For the first equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/5/f5507214a312b4e8009e11bba68cd7453d4ba0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 0$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />.  For the second equation, note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15fd3d8461569cb0e17c0cac9fd30b9f7dc3d4b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 = -x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"97\" height=\"15\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/9/9a9b0046a7446d1f3047baf2c28fd25355f57ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"11\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/500bd5be5f0a50fc2e936293f5e12bcc8d2d83d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\lfloor -3x-3 \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/612b27467fccc092ac3fc18e84fa57da3b7a6058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\tfrac{1}{3}^3 - \\tfrac13 + 1 = \\tfrac{16}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"136\" height=\"24\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/5/2f550e7556523012613f91fcadc2fdd344ba88fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\tfrac{2}{3}^3 - \\tfrac23 + 1 = \\tfrac{1}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"136\" height=\"24\" />, the root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/4/3d4beb153df1e55d7e7b32fca8549c9b6e0d2186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\tfrac23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"23\" height=\"21\" /> but more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d89e28927f2ccd7fc5422be24b2abf84882ce3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 &gt; -3x-3 &gt; -1\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a2148de4020b0bdb3116bd63b8db94be04b20a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m = \\lfloor -3x-3 \\rfloor = -1\\]\" width=\"167\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<b>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/5/1856d1187169543fb000d05181e60615e9f2eaa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + z^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /></b>\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2daa5bc10ab34796a83cc1453861e1010082c1bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 \\le z^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/4488bd866d039685455d0d05d9c9291c64bd6424.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 \\le \\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />.  From one of the original equations,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a531d971a7d550c655668c09b2cc35f554672c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[z^2 + x^4 = -y\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/9/4296ab6a4a5aa1d41cdf06d6ab954bfdddbcf212.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 - x^2 + x^4 + x = 0\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"16\" />\nUsing the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rational_Root_Theorem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rational Root Theorem\">Rational Root Theorem</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7edc76d091d6b684b15f217ef0c2bcc32e3f70.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+1)(x^3 - x^2 + 1) = 0\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"19\" />\nNote that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/3188ad58f2e07bba2e97042631b6117f934bf385.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 \\ge \\tfrac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"51\" height=\"21\" />, so that won’t work.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a73b707ee6836682a15595f281cd90afcd06fb32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> (where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/c/60c632dfe2dd9c8e9b2f677981b55d68f8e12610.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/6/1b667f99b88cc4dd636e45b0cdf1bf965992738a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\le 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />), so \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/5363db043975c911734b55e23678d30449f8d9d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^3 + a^2 = 1\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa5b2d3d9c75dde358a89733fc86a9c28bba4bfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\le \\tfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"54\" height=\"24\" />, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/7/fa7a07fb8a25008c96c6f868f6e763c2358fd761.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^3 + a^2 \\le \\frac{\\sqrt2}{4} + \\frac12\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/8/c586ba94f7e81883d4d34bb66528094f3781d597.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^3 + a^2 \\le \\frac{\\sqrt2 + 2}{4} &lt; 1\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"41\" />\nThus, there are no solutions in this case.\n</p><p><br />\nFrom the two cases, the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Modulo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Modulo\">modulo</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0db9f93bcba529c93ae151a1ac5c740eec7cca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" /> residue of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/3/d3323fc0a2855cdcdd261de7331e8e2ac78331d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" tit